        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759390/extras/0db9dc79dee3256f108fb3ffba65b709.poster.avif?t=1759130885\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759390/extras/0db9dc79dee3256f108fb3ffba65b709.webm?t=1759130885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759390/extras/0db9dc79dee3256f108fb3ffba65b709.mp4?t=1759130885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you’re never alone your loyal waifu is always by your side, right on your taskbar. She’s your cute, animated sidekick who cheers you on, reacts to your clicks, and grows stronger the more time you spend together. While you work, browse, or game, unlock cute accessories like hats, ears, and other fun add-ons. Customize her look, enjoy charming interactions, and let her keep you company as you conquer the day one idle tap at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yui is your sweet digital companion who lives right on your taskbar. Always by your side, she brings charm and cheer to your day. Yui keeps things simple give her a little click and she rewards you with a cute, satisfying bounce, adding a bit of fun to your daily routine.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759390/extras/087951c55c64c23698bff62b0b8f1ea0.avif?t=1759130885\" width=616 height=372 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yui  Your Gentle Desktop Companion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you go about your daily routine, Yui quietly watches over you from the corner of your screen. With her captivating blue eyes, soft smile, and calming presence, every moment feels a little warmer. What starts as a simple idle interaction soon turns into a comforting companionship. Whenever you need a little motivation, a peaceful distraction, or just a gentle smile, Yui is always there  your serene and beautiful waifu in the digital world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
